WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.234
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.167
Welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.267
You're here.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:05.434
You're watching at home.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:06.901
Thank you very much.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.167
Happy Friday, everyone.
Happy Friday.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.400
[ Cheers ]

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.701
You guys, it is officially --

00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:14.300
it's the holiday season
right now.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.734
We're in the thick of it.
Yeah.

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:17.434
This is the time of year,
we're all deciding

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.267
who's gift worthy
and who's gift card worthy.

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:20.868
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:23.734
But aren't the holidays
in New York a special time?

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.467
This morning, on the subway,

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.033
I saw a guy
wearing a Santa hat

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.200
and nothing else.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.234
And I just thought,
"It's that time of year."

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:32.968
Speaking of the city,
for the first time ever,

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:34.167
New York City has been named

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.267
the Most Expensive City
in the World.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.767
-Whooooo!

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:40.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.234
-Really?
You like that, sir?

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:45.501
Things are so expensive,
NBC can only afford

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:46.601
to plug in the bottom half

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:48.467
of the Rockefeller Center
Christmas tree.

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:49.501
That's the only part.

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:50.701
Things are so expensive,

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:53.200
the Statue of Liberty
just started an OnlyFans.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:55.868
Things are so expensive,

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.400
pickpockets are running
credit checks

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.901
to see if you're worth
the effort.

00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:00.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:01.601
But everyone's excited
about this --

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:03.667
tomorrow, the U.S.
plays The Netherlands

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.534
in the knockout round
of the World Cup.

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:07.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:08.734
Whooo!

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:13.634
That's right, tomorrow is
the highly anticipated

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:14.801
World Cup match

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:16.601
between the United States
and The Netherlands.

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:17.834
It's going to be
a tough challenge,

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:19.234
but I know we can do this,

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:20.934
especially if every person
in the studio

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.000
cheers their hardest.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.868
Say it with me.

00:01:22.868 --> 00:01:23.901
USA!

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:25.167
-USA!

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:27.868
USA! USA! USA!

00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:29.534
-Wait, sorry, stop, stop, stop.
Sorry.

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:32.667
I think I see someone
who's not cheering over there.

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:33.667
No -- yes.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:34.834
Yeah, you.

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:36.868
What is -- What is your name?

00:01:36.868 --> 00:01:39.033
-Uh, Gertrude, yeah?

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:40.534
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:43.767
-Welcome to the show,
Gertrude, yeah?

00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:46.133
I don't mean to be rude,
but where are you from?

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:48.300
-Um, I am from Tampa,

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.033
in your American state
of Florida.

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:54.901
-No, no, where are you
actually from, Gertrude, yeah?

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:58.767
-I am visiting from Eindhoven
in The Netherlands.

00:01:58.767 --> 00:01:59.834
-That's what I thought.

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:03.033
Now, I normally wouldn't
do this, but...

00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:04.267
get out of here.

00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:06.701
-Oh, no!

00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:08.200
-Get out of here!

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.701
Security!
-No!

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:12.434
-Get out!
-No, no, no, no!

00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:14.033
-Get out of here!

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.000
-Oh, no!
-Oh, my.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.934
Can -- No -- Try -- Oh, my.

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:20.634
For the love of --
Just help her out.

00:02:20.634 --> 00:02:22.000
Thank you very much.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.267
Gertrude.

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:24.834
So sorry you all
had to see that.

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:26.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:28.033
Gosh!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.868 --> 00:02:35.167
Well, this is interesting.

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:38.167
I saw that UNESCO has awarded
special protected status

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:39.400
to the French baguette.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.567
-Ooh.

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:42.434
-And get this,
French President Emmanuel Macron

00:02:42.434 --> 00:02:44.267
is in the country
for the state dinner,

00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:46.033
and he actually asked
if he could stop by here

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:47.868
and sing a song
about the good news.

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:49.167
So ladies and gentlemen,
please welcome

00:02:49.167 --> 00:02:51.534
French President
Emmanuel Macron.

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:53.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:58.901
♪♪

00:02:58.901 --> 00:03:01.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.534
♪ Bonjour ♪

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:07.801
♪ How do you do? ♪

00:03:07.801 --> 00:03:10.801
♪ I brought you a baguette
pour vous ♪

00:03:10.801 --> 00:03:13.033
♪ They're so hard to chew ♪

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:15.234
♪ But they're good
with fondue ♪

00:03:15.234 --> 00:03:16.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.567 --> 00:03:18.901
♪ Can I share one with you ♪

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:21.434
♪ As we stroll down the rue ♪

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:24.234
♪ With my chest hair in view ♪

00:03:24.234 --> 00:03:26.400
♪ I use special shampoo ♪

00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:30.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.934 --> 00:03:32.367
[ Whispers ] Selsun Bleu.

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:35.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.667
♪ We could go to the zoo ♪

00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:40.067
♪ Feed one to a kangaroo ♪

00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:42.300
♪ Then use your Roku ♪

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:44.701
♪ To watch "White Lotus"
season deux ♪

00:03:44.701 --> 00:03:47.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:52.000
♪ I got my Spotify review ♪

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.667
♪ My top band was U2 ♪

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.000
♪ Top song was "Deja Vu" ♪

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.334
♪ By Olivia Rodri-goo ♪

00:03:59.334 --> 00:04:00.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.834 --> 00:04:06.133
♪ Oh, before I forget ♪

00:04:06.133 --> 00:04:08.567
♪ We must save the baguette ♪

00:04:08.567 --> 00:04:11.067
♪ They're the hottest thing
from France ♪

00:04:11.067 --> 00:04:13.367
♪ Since Timothee Chalamet ♪

00:04:13.367 --> 00:04:14.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:17.167
♪ But my flight leaves
so soon ♪

00:04:17.167 --> 00:04:19.534
♪ I'm in boarding zone deux ♪

00:04:19.534 --> 00:04:24.234
♪ I'm flying JetBlue
with a layover in Honolulu ♪

00:04:24.234 --> 00:04:25.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.634 --> 00:04:29.501
♪ But for now,
I bid you adieu ♪

00:04:29.501 --> 00:04:33.334
♪ Adieu, adieu ♪

00:04:33.334 --> 00:04:35.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:35.367 --> 00:04:38.334
♪♪

00:04:40.501 --> 00:04:42.200
-French President
Emmanuel Macron.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.534
He ran away.

00:04:43.534 --> 00:04:45.300
He's in the hallway now.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.334
There he is. There he is.
There he is.

00:04:47.334 --> 00:04:51.534
That's the French President
with the Netherlands fan.

00:04:51.534 --> 00:04:54.200
And the French President...

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.534
Some movie news --
Today, "Top Gun: Maverick"

00:04:56.534 --> 00:04:58.934
